WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:36.850
Bakura's Diabound attacked from the shadows, destroying Slifer.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:43.060
But my other self used our power to summon Ra and defeat Bakura...

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.550
...or he should've.

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:49.240
Time rewound, and Bakura resurrected.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:52.620
And sent my other self plummeting.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:58.640
The Pharaoh Is Alive

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.770
A girl?

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:09.540
I don't care who it is!

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:11.530
Let’s defeat her first!

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:12.140
Yeah!

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:22.270
Show me the power of your Ka!

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:27.630
Aknadin…

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.810
What's wrong?  Summon your Ka!

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.690
Or you'll die!

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:38.840
Strange…  Even faced with death, she shows no sign of resistance.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.840
Does she really have a Ka?

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:47.120
What's this light?

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.140
Bring out your Ka!

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:57.560
Do it!

00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:59.660
What's wrong with you?

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.820
You're going to die!

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:06.500
She doesn't have a Ka!

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.030
Duos!

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.760
Seto, what are you doing?

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.700
What's your name?

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:32.660
Kisara.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.170
Kisara, stay close to me.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.220
A priest joined in?

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:45.630
We'll take out all the hardships we've faced on you!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.850
She can't summon her Ka.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:51.210
It's 2-on-1!  We have the advantage!

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.430
Don’t you dare hurt Seto!

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.840
Don’t move, gramps!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:02.830
Our lives are over, so we're willing to take the priest to hell with us!

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:06.060
Go ahead and try!

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.060
What?

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:09.710
Duos!  Aura Sword!

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:14.530
No way!

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:24.120
Seto!

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:32.890
Kisara, are you okay?

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:37.860
That was close.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:41.140
But this thing saved me.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:44.200
While your Ka is all wrapped up.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:45.950
Duos!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:50.380
You'll make a delicious meal.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:51.970
Devour him!

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.420
Seto!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:18.430
This is the white dragon I saw earlier!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.940
What is that dragon?

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:35.790
This white dragon is her Ka!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.580
Finish them!

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.630
Seto!

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:01.240
This is the power of the gods.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.760
What’s that light?

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.750
Let her sleep in her room.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.000
Seto.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:16.490
The white dragon may be more powerful than Bakura's Diabound.

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:19.520
Or even the Pharaoh’s three gods.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.520
That Ka is like no other.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.140
The white dragon is a Ba.

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:28.260
Seto, steal her Ka!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:35.060
But if her Ka and Ba are bound together, taking her white dragon will kill her!

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:37.000
Why do you hesitate?

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:41.480
Kill her and take her white dragon!

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.410
God will be yours!

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.490
Aknadin...

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:48.700
Then the throne will be yours!

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.810
As the new Pharaoh!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.420
Wait a second.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:55.970
We don't know the Pharaoh's status.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:59.050
The Pharaoh doesn't matter.

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:03.080
If the Pharaoh fails to return, do you know who's his successor?

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.450
It's you, Seto!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:09.300
Aknadin, the Pharaoh is still alive!

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:12.680
I'm not a god, so this is not my role!

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:16.340
This land needs the Pharaoh’s leadership!

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:19.020
Our priority is to find him!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.610
Seto…

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:22.020
I'm leaving.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:35.770
Fine.  You’ll learn your destiny soon enough, my son.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:51.530
Nice.  I didn't think I’d acquire the Millennium Puzzle so quickly.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.520
Aknadin is already my pawn.

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:57.090
And the other priests are weak.

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.020
Follow the hoofprints here if you want.

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:10.960
You must be happy.

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:14.440
By gathering all the Millennium Items, the door to the afterlife will open.

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:18.160
Resurrecting my true identity - Zorc.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.480
That's when the eighth key will appear.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:27.330
And I’ll be able to release Zorc in the real world.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.400
Why are you upset?

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:43.960
You're hurting me!

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:49.610
What's angering you?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.610
Wait a sec.  The eighth key is...

00:08:53.870 --> 00:09:00.250
Oh no!  The eighth key was used to seal up Zorc 3,000 years ago!

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:08.120
So the key will only appear in this world when the Pharaoh seals up Zorc!

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.760
But I killed the Pharaoh!

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:15.670
But wait… This game is still going on.

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:21.800
That means there’s still a way to get the eighth key, even without the Pharaoh.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.680
Think.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:31.400
3,000 years ago, the Pharaoh used the eighth key to seal everything inside this.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:35.500
And made sure no one could know what the eighth key was.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.590
How would he do that?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:41.220
By erasing all evidence.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.570
Erase...

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:51.150
I know what the eighth key is.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:06.340
I’m hungry and thirsty!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.350
Ouch!

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.850
Get off of us, Bobasa!

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:15.200
Water!

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.250
Hey!

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:17.300
Wait up!

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.420
What’s this?

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.820
It's the Nile River.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.940
Wow!

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:28.100
Where's my other self?

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:32.130
The river was below the cliff.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:34.980
If we follow the Nile, we'll find him!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:35.950
Yeah.

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:37.580
Water!

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:40.740
Wait up, Bobasa!

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.120
There!

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.190
I did it!

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:34.810
Yeah!  I got the hang of it!

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:42.140
C'mon!  Move!

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.160
Ouch!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.810
I failed again.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:12:01.780
No matter how hard I train, I'm no good, Master.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.150
Is she Dark Magician Girl?

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:08.740
That’s ridiculous!

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.080
But she looks like her.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:10.880
Yeah.

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:14.540
Prince!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.960
What are you doing here, Prince?

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.760
Wearing weird clothes?

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.800
Hanging with weird people?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.300
Weird people?

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.330
She can see us?

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:27.260
Are you friends with Bobasa?

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:36.160
Bobasa likes to eat!

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:39.040
Bobasa, where were you?

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:42.450
Cool, right?

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.110
That’s Yugi’s cloak!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.310
Where'd you find it?

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:50.320
Bobasa went fishing to eat.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:52.490
This isn't a fish!  It’s a cloak!

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:53.680
Where’d you find it?

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:55.950
But I can’t eat a cloak.

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:58.430
That’s not what I mean!

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:01.240
The cloak was in the river?

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.700
Yes.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.690
Yugi could be nearby.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.570
I hope so.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:10.360
Unless the river swept him away.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:12.590
Don't say things like that!

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:15.360
I’m sure my other self is nearby.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.420
Let's find him!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.910
Wait!

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:21.140
That’s the Prince’s cloak!

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:22.080
Prince?

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:25.080
My mistake.  The Pharaoh.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.290
Pharaoh?

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:30.920
You know my other self?

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:33.470
You're really not the Prince?

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:38.250
I’m-  We're the Pharaoh's friends!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.700
Friends?

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:45.790
If you know Yugi- I mean the Pharaoh, help us find him.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.570
What happened to the Prince?

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:49.370
We don’t know where he is.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:51.480
Say that earlier!

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:53.240
I’ll help you search!

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:56.280
Here they come!

00:13:56.280 --> 00:14:00.150
They serve Bakura - the one who killed my master.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:03.160
Are you really the Prince's friends?

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:03.930
Yeah.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.060
Then you’re friends of mine!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.170
Wow!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:21.180
Now’s our chance to find the Prince!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:34.540
Pharaoh!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:43.720
Pharaoh!

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:50.820
Shada, we searched this entire area, but there's no sign of the Pharaoh.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.360
I see.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:54.800
Any word on Bakura?

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:55.900
Shada!

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.900
We picked up Bakura’s trail!

00:14:58.900 --> 00:14:59.880
What?

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:03.760
Is that Spiria?

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:08.600
Isis, find the Pharaoh.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:28.380
That’s the Millennium Puzzle.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:34.480
Bakura stole the Millennium Puzzle.

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.000
Nonsense!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.140
"Sacred Pharaoh?"

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:47.200
Aknamkanon made the Millennium Items in order to gain evil power!

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:51.900
It's true that whoever has a Millennium Item gains incredible power.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:57.140
But it responds to the evil within their heart.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:16:01.600
And drags them into the darkness.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:07.240
Father, why did you create the Millennium Items?

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:13.900
Did you not realize that they would cause disaster?

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:17.220
But you're not here to answer these questions.

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:20.140
I don’t even remember my father.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.420
What’s this?

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:27.820
How glorious!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:32.520
The Pharaoh's successor is born!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:35.540
The Pharaoh’s successor…

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:28.320
This person who loves me must be my father.

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:44.500
Father, I don’t want to go.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:48.670
If you're going to be the next Pharaoh, don't say things like that.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.940
Okay, Father.

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:57.710
I can sense the fear in his voice.

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:04.430
Father, I actually don't want to go.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:06.060
Too bad.  Let’s go.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.740
Wait, Father!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.090
Father!

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:44.410
Spirits of our great ancestors, I’ve committed an unforgivable sin.

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:50.960
It's my fault for creating the seven Millennium Items.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:56.430
Please do not have my son face any calamities.

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:59.960
Let me bear all the punishments.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:03.820
Father, are you crying?

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:14.300
I...

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:18.320
I will bear all the punishments.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:22.830
I still know of my Father's love.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.000
Who are you?

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.640
My name is Hasan.

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:33.860
Hasan?

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:38.110
Pharaoh, the evil Zorc is attempting to revive.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.810
Only you can defeat Zorc.

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:41.880
Zorc?

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:45.850
The previous Pharaoh - Aknamkanon - is watching over you.

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:48.190
You know my Father?

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.080
Hasan!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.170
That's why you started training in magic?

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:24.920
But I'm no good.

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:28.160
I'm no match for my Master.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:34.240
There's a card game in our world.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:38.300
And one of the cards looks just like you.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.380
Just like me?

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:45.310
She’s a powerful spellcaster named Dark Magician Girl.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:49.820
If you work hard, you'll be as strong as Dark Magician Girl.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:52.830
What's your name?

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.830
I'm Mana.

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.260
Dark Magician Girl, huh?

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:59.550
That sounds cool!

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.470
I’ll try my best!

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:08.300
The Bo in Bobasa stands for...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.070
Don’t stop suddenly, Bobasa!

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:14.990
Are you listening to me?

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:20.680
Yugi!

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.210
Hey!

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.230
Partner!  Everyone!

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:27.000
My other self!

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:30.000
Yugi!  You're alive!

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.770
Yugi…  Thank goodness.

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.800
Prince!

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:39.040
Yugi!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.140
Prince!

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:14.290
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:30.010
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.730 --> 00:22:35.850
Without a goal in mind

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:44.420
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:50.060
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:58.530
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:04.340
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:12.480
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.670 --> 00:23:15.740
In a duel

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:30.010
Yugi, you're okay!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:35.820
I thought you'd be alive, but I was still worried until I saw you.

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:41.340
But Bakura stole your Millennium Puzzle, and you haven't regained your memories.

00:23:41.340 --> 00:23:46.400
Shada told Yugi of Bakura's location, so he's going to Kul Elna Village.

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:50.040
Be careful!  You don't know what traps await!

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:52.260
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Ghost Village

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:53.840
Stay tuned!
